  <p>When you visit the Site, we automatically collect certain information about your device, including your browser, IP address, time zone, and cookies installed on your device, as well as the pages or products you view (“Device Information”).</p>
  <p>When you make or attempt to make a purchase, we also collect your name, shipping/billing address, payment information, email address, and phone number (“Order Information”). Together, Device Information and Order Information are referred to as “Personal Information”.</p>
